# Graphs generated from YOUR OWN SMAC install are derived copyrighted game
# data and are never committed. The Thinker-sourced graph under
# datalinks/thinker/ is committed: it comes from the MIT-licensed fork's
# public repo and is tagged house-rule, not canonical.
# Root-anchored so it cannot swallow orchestrator/src/neural_amplifier/datalinks/.
/datalinks/*
!/datalinks/thinker/
